 "name_en": "External Billing (1Z6)",
 "description_en_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>External Billing (1Z6)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio49d6937ca5044e4fa397272d33573bec\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio49d6937ca5044e4fa397272d33573bec__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Overview</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">This scope item enables the use of the external billing interface to create billing documents, without predecessor documents in SD calling from an external system (SAP or non-SAP).</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">The scope item encompasses the necessary customizing to run business application programming interfaces (BAPIs) for exchanging billing data between your SAP or non-SAP on-premise system and your <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition</span> system.</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio49d6937ca5044e4fa397272d33573bec__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Key Process Flow</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Check that an invoice is created via the external billing interface in target system</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Check invoice cancellation executed via the external billing interface in target system</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio49d6937ca5044e4fa397272d33573bec__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">Business Benefits</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">Save time and effort with this automated creation of billing documents</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Reduce number of documents in the system because sales documents are not necessary</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">Offers an automated lean process for invoice creation</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "description_zh_html": "<!DOCTYPE html SYSTEM \"about:legacy-compat\">\n<html lang=\"en-us\">\n <head>\n  <meta http-equiv=\"Content-Type\" content=\"text/html; charset=UTF-8\">\n  <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n  <meta name=\"copyright\" content=\"(C) Copyright 2025\">\n  <meta name=\"generator\" content=\"DITA-OT\">\n  <link rel=\"stylesheet\" type=\"text/css\" href=\"commonltr.css\">\n  <title>外部开票 (1Z6)</title>\n </head>\n <body id=\"loio49d6937ca5044e4fa397272d33573bec\">\n  <main role=\"main\">\n   <article role=\"article\" aria-labelledby=\"ariaid-title1\">\n    <div class=\"body conbody\">\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio49d6937ca5044e4fa397272d33573bec__sol_var_overview\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">概览</h2>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目允许使用外部开票接口创建开票凭证，无需在 SD 中调用来自外部系统（SAP 或非 SAP）的前趋凭证。</p>\n      <p class=\"p\">此范围项目包括运行业务应用程序编程接口 (BAPI) 所需的定制，以在 SAP 或非 SAP 企业预置系统和 <span class=\"ph pname\">SAP S/4HANA Cloud Public Edition</span> 系统之间交换开票数据。</p>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio49d6937ca5044e4fa397272d33573bec__key_process_flow\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">关键流程流</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">检查是否通过目标系统中的外部开票接口创建发票。</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">在目标系统中通过外部开票接口执行检查发票取消。</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n     <section class=\"section\" id=\"loio49d6937ca5044e4fa397272d33573bec__business_benefits\">\n      <h2 class=\"title sectiontitle\">业务优势</h2>\n      <ul class=\"ul\">\n       <li class=\"li\">通过自动创建开票凭证，节省时间和精力</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">减少系统中的凭证数量，因为不需要销售凭证</li>\n       <li class=\"li\">为发票创建提供自动精简流程</li>\n      </ul>\n     </section>\n    </div>\n   </article>\n  </main>\n </body>\n</html>",
 "name_zh": "外部开票 (1Z6)",
